{"s":83,"v":[{"t":"Woe to those who give less [than due],","w":[["وَيْلٌۭ","Woe","waylun",""],["لِّلْمُطَفِّفِينَ","to those who give less","lil'muṭaffifīna","",[["لِّ",8],["لْ",2],["مُطَفِّفِينَ",4388]]]]},{"t":"Who, when they take a measure from people, take in full.","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who","alladhīna",""],["إِذَا","when","idhā",""],["ٱكْتَالُوا۟","they take a measure","ik'tālū","",[["ٱكْتَالُ",2203],["وا۟",3]]],["عَلَى","from","ʿalā",""],["ٱلنَّاسِ","the people","l-nāsi","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّاسِ",67]]],["يَسْتَوْفُونَ","they take in full","yastawfūna","",[["يَسْتَوْفُ",4712],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss.","w":[["وَإِذَا","But when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["كَالُوهُمْ","they give by measure (to) them","kālūhum","",[["كَالُ",2576],["و",3],["هُمْ",3]]],["أَو","or","aw",""],["وَّزَنُوهُمْ","they weigh (for) them","wazanūhum","",[["وَّزَنُ",2050],["و",3],["هُمْ",3]]],["يُخْسِرُونَ","they give less","yukh'sirūna","",[["يُخْسِرُ",2810],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"Do they not think that they will be resurrected","w":[["أَلَا","Do not","alā","",[["أَ",31],["لَا",13]]],["يَظُنُّ","think","yaẓunnu",""],["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","those","ulāika","",[["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["أَنَّهُم","that they","annahum","",[["أَنَّ",41],["هُم",3]]],["مَّبْعُوثُونَ","(will be) resurrected","mabʿūthūna",""]]},{"t":"For a tremendous Day -","w":[["لِيَوْمٍ","For a Day","liyawmin","",[["لِ",8],["يَوْمٍ",33]]],["عَظِيمٍۢ","Great","ʿaẓīmin",""]]},{"t":"The Day when mankind will stand before the Lord of the worlds?","w":[["يَوْمَ","(The) Day","yawma",""],["يَقُومُ","will stand","yaqūmu",""],["ٱلنَّاسُ","mankind","l-nāsu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّاسُ",67]]],["لِرَبِّ","before (the) Lord","lirabbi","",[["لِ",8],["رَبِّ",24]]],["ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","(of) the worlds","l-ʿālamīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَـٰلَمِينَ",174]]]]},{"t":"No! Indeed, the record of the wicked is in sijjeen.","w":[["كَلَّآ","Nay","kallā",""],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["كِتَـٰبَ","(the) record","kitāba",""],["ٱلْفُجَّارِ","(of) the wicked","l-fujāri","",[["ٱلْ",2],["فُجَّارِ",1594]]],["لَفِى","(is) surely in","lafī","",[["لَ",23],["فِى",14]]],["سِجِّينٍۢ","Sijjin","sijjīnin",""]]},{"t":"And what can make you know what is sijjeen?","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","can make you know","adrāka","",[["أَدْرَىٰ",558],["كَ",18]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["سِجِّينٌۭ","(is) Sijjin","sijjīnun",""]]},{"t":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed.","w":[["كِتَـٰبٌۭ","A book","kitābun",""],["مَّرْقُومٌۭ","written","marqūmun",""]]},{"t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers,","w":[["وَيْلٌۭ","Woe","waylun",""],["يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","that Day","yawma-idhin","",[["يَوْمَ",33],["ئِذٍۢ",50]]],["لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","to the deniers","lil'mukadhibīna","",[["لِّ",8],["لْ",2],["مُكَذِّبِينَ",497]]]]},{"t":"Who deny the Day of Recompense.","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who","alladhīna",""],["يُكَذِّبُونَ","deny","yukadhibūna","",[["يُكَذِّبُ",80],["ونَ",3]]],["بِيَوْمِ","(the) Day","biyawmi","",[["بِ",10],["يَوْمِ",33]]],["ٱلدِّينِ","(of) the Judgment","l-dīni","",[["ٱل",2],["دِّينِ",136]]]]},{"t":"And none deny it except every sinful transgressor.","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يُكَذِّبُ","can deny","yukadhibu",""],["بِهِۦٓ","[of] it","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦٓ",5]]],["إِلَّا","except","illā",""],["كُلُّ","every","kullu",""],["مُعْتَدٍ","transgressor","muʿ'tadin",""],["أَثِيمٍ","sinful","athīmin",""]]},{"t":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\"","w":[["إِذَا","When","idhā",""],["تُتْلَىٰ","are recited","tut'lā",""],["عَلَيْهِ","to him","ʿalayhi","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِ",5]]],["ءَايَـٰتُنَا","Our Verses","āyātunā","",[["ءَايَـٰتُ",39],["نَا",11]]],["قَالَ","he says","qāla",""],["أَسَـٰطِيرُ","Stories","asāṭīru",""],["ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","(of) the former (people)","l-awalīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَوَّلِينَ",155]]]]},{"t":"No! Rather, the stain has covered their h